      "trackName": "MeMaze",
      "description": "MeMaze - Evolve Your Memory and Associative Series!\n\nChallenge yourself with MeMaze, the ultimate brain-training game! Follow colorful patterns, tap the right sequence, and see how long you can keep up. With each round, the game gets faster and the patterns more complex— can you handle the pressure?\n\nKey Features:\n* Classic Mode: Match the flashing lights and sounds.\n* +1 Mode: Compete with friends by generating your own sequence.\n* Sandbox: Set convenient rules to practice or challenge.\n* Customiser: Choose shape and colors.\n\nTrain your brain, improve your memory, and have a fun with MeMaze. How far can you go?",
